category: Video
requires: libaravis0.8_0 libglib2.0-devel libusb1.0-devel libxml2-devel pkg-config zlib-devel
sdesc: "Library for video acquisition using Genicam cameras (development)"
ldesc: "Aravis is a glib/gobject based library for video acquisition using Genicam
cameras. It currently only implements an ethernet camera protocol used for
industrial cameras."
external-source: aravis

